__tests__/ and production-route tests under src/daemon/threads/__tests__/. New test paths in the plan remain explicitly proposed.\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"acceptanceMapping\": [\n        {\n          \"criterionId\": \"ac1\",\n          \"provingTests\": [\n            \"Exact scope/projection/evidence equivalence oracle over all171files and selected after/deletion spans.\",\n            \"Pinned code versus latest-design capture/target-monitor matrix; fresh independence/route checks despite warm context.\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"criterionId\": \"ac2\",\n          \"provingTests\": [\n            \"Production lifecycle from admission through assessment, retry/resume, publication, approval and cleanup consumes one context contract.\",\n            \"Every code story/task and workflow route and every design artifact route is exercised; repeated publication uses saved feedback with0modelcalls.\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"criterionId\": \"ac3\",\n          \"provingTests\": [\n            \"Counting source plan proves physical duplicate count0 across historical/current inputs; batched Git verifies identical object/projection witnesses.\",\n            \"Budget hits, batch splitting, per-object oversize and missing refs fail precisely without omitted scope;1/4/max supported history scaling.\",\n            \"Memory-pressure/disk-reservation and interleaved-session retention fixtures.\",\n            \"Construction, staged packet inventory and every warm/cold lifecycle consumer obey the combined memory reservation high-water; no aggregate hydration.\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"criterionId\": \"ac4\",\n          \"provingTests\": [\n            \"Writer instrumentation proves0full-historywrites per nativecommand, bounded runtime bytes, and complete checkpoint writes at result boundaries.\",\n            \"Crash injection proves durable open-before-spawn and confirmed-disposal-before